 This is the source code of [Fizzy](https://fizzy.do/), the Kanban tracking tool for issues and ideas by [37signals](https://37signals.com).
 
 
+## Self-hosting
+
+You are welcome to run Fizzy on your own box. The repository ships with a [Kamal](https://kamal-deploy.org) config for a single server: one container, SQLite, background jobs, and SSL from the proxy. See the [Self-hosting guide](docs/self-hosting.md).
+
+
 ## Development
 
 You are welcome -- and encouraged -- to modify Fizzy to your liking.
